{"path":"packages/cli/src/catalog-settings.ts","start":40568,"end":41270,"kind":"delivery-boundary","boundary_name":"active-preview-catalog-boundary","line_end":1075,"raw":"	/**
	 * Point the Settings view at the previewed interface catalog. Only this view's
	 * own text changes: no file, prompt, or session state is touched.
